    },
    "Spoken cues say the next exercise and side, its suggested weight and last time, an interval's pace and round, and when a rest or a hold ends, only while Fernlet is open. In headphones your music dips while they speak and a podcast pauses, then both carry on; on the phone's speaker they follow your ring/silent switch. With VoiceOver on, VoiceOver says them instead." : {
      "comment" : "Workout setup sheet: the note under the Spoken cues switch. Music is ducked (made quieter), never paused, in headphones; a podcast or audiobook pauses and resumes. 'ring/silent switch' is the iPhone's Ring/Silent switch or Action button setting.",
